OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FMouse support            
OL,3,   EUltimateD]Gand operation            
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,BSupported mice                         
OL,6, Just plug in aF1351 mouseGand enjoy! If
OL,7, you have a C64 Ultimate or Ultimate 64,
OL,8, a USB mouse also works. Same for USB   
OL,9, mice for connected via aFMouSTer.      
OL,10, Note: Only Port 1 is supported.        
OL,12,BMouse pointer                          
OL,13, The mouse pointer is not visible by    
OL,14, default. It shows itself when movement 
OL,15, is detected. I always liked theCAmiga  
OL,16,CWorkbench 1.3Gmouse pointer, so I      
OL,17, recreated it. It is made out 3 overlay-
OL,18, ing sprites.                           
OL,20,BOperation                              
OL,21,FLeft clickGa page number to visit. This
OL,22, also works for fastext links. AFright  
OL,23,D]F306G<<                >>F308 B]D1/2  
OL,24,AMain page  BA-Z Index  CInstall  FAbout
