OL,0,          BTXT64  GFri 20.11.26 17:56:20
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,2,FTeletextC64D]FMouse support            
OL,3,   EUltimateD]Gand operation            
OL,4,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,5,FclickGbrings you back to the previous  
OL,6, page. Left clicking on the right or    
OL,7, bottom egde of the screen brings you to
OL,8, the next subpage.                      
OL,10, TheFmouse menuGicon is located in the  
OL,11, top left corner. Hover over the icon   
OL,12, will show a tiny menu with 5 options:  
OL,13,C(M)          G station select menu     
OL,14,C(-)           GPage Down (-1)          
OL,15,C(+)           GPage Up (+1)            
OL,16,C(arrow up)    GPrevious subpage        
OL,17,C(arrow down)  GNext supage             
